First release of HivePulse.

Scan the QR code on a hive, log the visit, done: brood and honey frames, queen, temperament, varroa, treatments, feed, your own notes. Numbers are large buttons so it works with gloves on.

Works without a signal: anything recorded offline is stored and sent on by itself later.

Plus statistics per hive and apiary, your own fields, and the hornet tracker.

